   "m_classType": "JavaScriptAction",
   "m_comment": "if+there+is+is+any+problem+in+`from`+folder+during+file+transfer,+disable+this+action.+It+is+used+to+add+\"/\"+at+the+end+of+your+paths+if+you+forgot+at+first+point.+(read+instructions+manual)",
